{
  "$schema": "./recipe-schema.json",
  "meta": {
    "schemaVersion": "3.1.0",
    "component": "range",
    "version": "2.0.0",
    "status": "stable",
    "tags": [
      "interactive",
      "form",
      "range"
    ],
    "links": {
      "figma": "",
      "storybook": "",
      "docs": "/docs/range-docs"
    },
    "layer": "atom",
    "pipeline": {
      "scss": [
        "scss/scss/05-atoms/_range.scss"
      ],
      "story": "stories/atoms/slider.stories.js",
      "arena": "apps/theme-configurator/src/components/laboratory/RangeArena.vue",
      "drupal": [],
      "docs": "docs/slider-docs.html"
    },
    "renamedFrom": "slider",
    "renameNote": "Hiess bis zum 18.08.2026 slider. Unter demselben Namen lief ein zweites, voellig anderes Bauteil in 06-molecules: ein Karussell. Das Molekuel lud spaeter und ueberschrieb die Wurzel dieses Reglers mit display:grid — Recipe und Story beschrieben den Regler, das CSS lieferte das Karussell."
  },
  "anatomy": {
    "root": {
      "element": ".nc-range"
    },
    "slots": [
      {
        "name": "input",
        "element": ".nc-range__input",
        "optional": false
      },
      {
        "name": "input-max",
        "element": ".nc-range__input--max",
        "optional": true,
        "note": "Zweiter Input fuer Range-Modus (Dual-Thumb). Nur bei --range Modifier."
      },
      {
        "name": "track",
        "element": ".nc-range__track",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "fill",
        "element": ".nc-range__fill",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "tooltip",
        "element": ".nc-range__tooltip",
        "optional": true,
        "note": "Floating Tooltip ueber dem Thumb — folgt der Position via --nc-range-progress CSS-Variable."
      },
      {
        "name": "output",
        "element": ".nc-range__output",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "labels",
        "element": ".nc-range__labels",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "label-min",
        "element": ".nc-range__label-min",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "label-max",
        "element": ".nc-range__label-max",
        "optional": true
      }
    ],
    "convenience": [],
    "domNotes": [
      "Native <input type='range'> mit Cross-Browser Custom-Styling via Pseudo-Elemente.",
      "WebKit: ::-webkit-slider-runnable-track + ::-webkit-slider-thumb.",
      "Firefox: ::-moz-range-track + ::-moz-range-thumb + ::-moz-range-progress (gefuellter Bereich).",
      "Thumb wird via margin-top auf dem Track zentriert (WebKit).",
      "CSS-Variable --nc-range-progress (0-100) steuert Fill-Breite und Tooltip-Position.",
      "Floating Tooltip: Schwebt ueber dem Thumb, sichtbar bei Hover/Focus/Active. Position via left: calc(var(--nc-range-progress) * 1%). Pfeil zeigt nach unten.",
      "Range-Modus: Zwei ueberlagerte <input type='range'> — pointer-events: none auf dem Input, auto auf den Thumbs. Fill-Bereich zwischen --nc-range-progress-min und --nc-range-progress-max.",
      "Touch-Target: Input-Hoehe = --nc-range-thumb-touch-size (44px, WCAG 2.5.8). Der sichtbare Thumb bleibt --nc-range-thumb-size.",
      "Focus-Ring: outline mit --nc-range-thumb-focus-ring-offset (2px) direkt auf dem Pseudo-Element-Thumb, nicht auf dem gesamten Input.",
      "Output zeigt aktuellen Wert (Tooltip oder Text, via JS aktualisiert).",
      "Labels zeigen Min/Max-Werte unterhalb des Tracks.",
      "Hover: Thumb scale(1.15). Focus: focus-ring + border-color auf Thumb.",
      "Vertikale Variante via writing-mode: vertical-lr + direction: rtl.",
      "Forced-Colors: Thumb = ButtonText, Track = Canvas + 1px solid ButtonText.",
      "prefers-reduced-motion: Thumb-Transitions werden deaktiviert."
    ]
  },
  "axes": {
    "orientation": {
      "label": "Orientation",
      "description": "Ausrichtung — horizontal (Standard) / vertical (Hochformat, 200px Hoehe)",
      "values": {
        "horizontal": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "renderHint": "slider-horizontal"
        },
        "vertical": {
          "modifier": "nc-range--vertical",
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "renderHint": "slider-vertical"
        }
      }
    },
    "mode": {
      "label": "Mode",
      "description": "Slider-Modus — single (ein Wert, Standard) / range (zwei Thumbs fuer Min/Max-Spanne)",
      "values": {
        "single": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "note": "Standard: Ein Thumb, ein Wert."
        },
        "range": {
          "modifier": "nc-range--range",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "range"
          ],
          "note": "Dual-Thumb fuer Preisspannen, Zeitraeume etc. Braucht zwei Inputs."
        }
      }
    },
    "display": {
      "label": "Display",
      "description": "Anzeige-Optionen — plain (nur Slider), with-tooltip (Floating Tooltip), with-output (statische Wert-Anzeige), with-labels (Min/Max), full (Tooltip + Labels)",
      "values": {
        "plain": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "renderHint": "slider-plain"
        },
        "with-tooltip": {
          "modifier": "nc-range--tooltip",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "tooltip"
          ],
          "slotConfig": {
            "tooltip": true
          },
          "renderHint": "slider-tooltip"
        },
        "with-output": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "slotConfig": {
            "output": true
          },
          "renderHint": "slider-output"
        },
        "with-labels": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "slotConfig": {
            "labels": true,
            "label-min": true,
            "label-max": true
          },
          "renderHint": "slider-labels"
        },
        "full": {
          "modifier": "nc-range--tooltip",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "tooltip"
          ],
          "slotConfig": {
            "tooltip": true,
            "labels": true,
            "label-min": true,
            "label-max": true
          },
          "renderHint": "slider-full"
        }
      }
    },
    "validation": {
      "label": "Validation",
      "description": "Validierungs-State — none (Standard), error (Fehler-Markierung auf Thumb und Fill)",
      "values": {
        "none": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "renderHint": "slider-default"
        },
        "error": {
          "modifier": "nc-range--error",
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "renderHint": "slider-error"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "states": {
    "supported": [
      "default",
      "hover",
      "active",
      "focus",
      "disabled"
    ],
    "precedence": [
      "disabled",
      "focus",
      "active",
      "hover",
      "default"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "state": "hover",
        "unless": [
          "disabled"
        ],
        "note": "Hover: Thumb skaliert auf 1.15 — nur wenn nicht disabled."
      },
      {
        "state": "active",
        "unless": [
          "disabled"
        ],
        "note": "Active: Tooltip sichtbar, Thumb in voller Groesse. Ziehen des Sliders."
      },
      {
        "state": "focus",
        "unless": [
          "disabled"
        ],
        "note": "Focus: outline mit offset auf dem Thumb via :focus-visible."
      },
      {
        "state": "disabled",
        "unless": [],
        "note": "Disabled: Reduzierte Opacity, pointer-events: none, cursor: not-allowed. Tooltip versteckt."
      }
    ],
    "interactive": true
  },
  "a11y": {
    "base": {
      "interactive": true,
      "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA non-text (3:1)",
      "assertions": [
        "hasAccessibleName",
        "supportsKeyboard"
      ],
      "note": "Native <input type='range'> — volle Keyboard-Unterstuetzung (Arrow-Keys, Home/End, Page Up/Down). aria-valuemin, aria-valuemax, aria-valuenow fuer Screen Reader. aria-valuetext fuer menschenlesbare Werte (z.B. '50%'). aria-label oder assoziiertes <label> fuer Benennung. Touch-Target mindestens 44x44px (WCAG 2.5.8). Focus-Ring auf dem Thumb, nicht auf dem Input-Feld."
    },
    "overrides": [
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "validation": [
              "error"
            ]
          }
        },
        "suggest": [
          "aria-invalid",
          "aria-describedby"
        ],
        "note": "Error-State: aria-invalid='true' auf dem Input. Fehlermeldung via aria-describedby verknuepft."
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "states": [
            "disabled"
          ]
        },
        "suggest": [
          "aria-disabled"
        ],
        "note": "Disabled: disabled-Attribut auf dem Input. Alternativ aria-disabled='true'."
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "mode": [
              "range"
            ]
          }
        },
        "suggest": [
          "aria-label-min",
          "aria-label-max"
        ],
        "note": "Range-Modus: Jeder Input braucht ein eigenes aria-label, z.B. 'Minimum Preis' und 'Maximum Preis'. aria-valuemin/aria-valuemax unabhaengig setzen."
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "display": [
              "with-tooltip"
            ]
          }
        },
        "suggest": [
          "aria-hidden-tooltip"
        ],
        "note": "Floating Tooltip ist rein visuell — aria-hidden='true'. Der Wert wird bereits via aria-valuenow/aria-valuetext kommuniziert."
      }
    ]
  },
  "constraints": {
    "rules": [
      {
        "when": {},
        "require": [
          "accessible-name"
        ],
        "notes": [
          "Slider braucht ein assoziiertes <label> oder aria-label."
        ]
      },
      {
        "when": {},
        "require": [
          "aria-valuemin",
          "aria-valuemax"
        ],
        "notes": [
          "Min- und Max-Werte muessen kommuniziert werden."
        ]
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "mode": [
              "range"
            ]
          }
        },
        "require": [
          "two-inputs",
          "aria-labels-per-thumb"
        ],
        "notes": [
          "Range-Modus braucht zwei <input> Elemente mit jeweils eigenem aria-label."
        ]
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "display": [
              "with-tooltip",
              "full"
            ]
          }
        },
        "severity": "warn",
        "notes": [
          "Floating Tooltip muss aria-hidden='true' haben — Wert wird via aria-valuenow kommuniziert."
        ]
      }
    ],
    "copy": {
      "ariaValuetext": {
        "maxChars": 50,
        "note": "aria-valuetext beschreibt den Wert menschenlesbar: z.B. '50 Prozent', '25 Euro'."
      }
    }
  },
  "styling": {
    "baseClasses": [
      "nc-slider"
    ],
    "baseTokenGroups": [
      "track",
      "thumb",
      "interaction",
      "state-disabled"
    ],
    "tokenGroups": {
      "track": {
        "label": "Track",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-range-track-height",
          "nc-range-track-bg",
          "nc-range-track-bg-active",
          "nc-range-track-radius"
        ]
      },
      "thumb": {
        "label": "Thumb",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-range-thumb-size",
          "nc-range-thumb-bg",
          "nc-range-thumb-border",
          "nc-range-thumb-border-width",
          "nc-range-thumb-shadow",
          "nc-range-thumb-touch-size",
          "nc-range-thumb-focus-ring-offset"
        ]
      },
      "interaction": {
        "label": "Interaction",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-range-transition-duration",
          "nc-range-transition-timing"
        ]
      },
      "tooltip": {
        "label": "Floating Tooltip",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-range-tooltip-bg",
          "nc-range-tooltip-color",
          "nc-range-tooltip-radius",
          "nc-range-tooltip-font-size",
          "nc-range-tooltip-padding",
          "nc-range-tooltip-offset-y"
        ]
      },
      "range": {
        "label": "Range (Dual Thumb)",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-range-range-fill-bg"
        ]
      },
      "state-disabled": {
        "label": "Disabled",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-range-disabled-opacity"
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "recipes": {
    "mode": "derived",
    "derive": {
      "from": [
        "axes",
        "states",
        "styling.tokenGroups"
      ],
      "output": [
        "classList",
        "resolvedTokens",
        "a11yAssertions"
      ]
    },
    "resolution": {
      "classList": [
        "styling.baseClasses",
        "axes.orientation.values.*.modifier",
        "axes.mode.values.*.modifier",
        "axes.display.values.*.modifier",
        "axes.validation.values.*.modifier"
      ],
      "tokenGroups": [
        "styling.baseTokenGroups",
        "axes.*.values.*.tokenGroups"
      ]
    }
  },
  "specimens": [
    {
      "id": "all-states",
      "label": "All States",
      "description": "Slider in allen Zustaenden: default, hover, active, focus, disabled",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "orientation": [
            "horizontal"
          ],
          "mode": [
            "single"
          ],
          "display": [
            "plain"
          ],
          "validation": [
            "none"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default",
          "hover",
          "active",
          "focus",
          "disabled"
        ]
      },
      "layout": "row",
      "render": {
        "label": "{state}"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA non-text (3:1)",
        "note": "Track und Thumb muessen 3:1 Kontrast gegen Hintergrund haben. Focus-Ring mit 2px offset auf dem Thumb bei :focus-visible."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "floating-tooltip",
      "label": "Floating Tooltip",
      "description": "Tooltip schwebt ueber dem Thumb und folgt der Position. Sichtbar bei Hover, Focus und Active.",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "orientation": [
            "horizontal"
          ],
          "mode": [
            "single"
          ],
          "display": [
            "with-tooltip"
          ],
          "validation": [
            "none"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default",
          "hover",
          "focus"
        ]
      },
      "focusTokenGroups": [
        "tooltip"
      ],
      "layout": "row",
      "render": {
        "label": "{state}",
        "compositionType": "slider-tooltip"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Tooltip-Text braucht 4.5:1 Kontrast. Tooltip ist aria-hidden='true' — Wert wird via aria-valuenow kommuniziert."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "range-slider",
      "label": "Range Slider (Dual Thumb)",
      "description": "Zwei Thumbs fuer Min/Max-Auswahl. Fill-Bereich zwischen den Thumbs in Markenfarbe.",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "orientation": [
            "horizontal"
          ],
          "mode": [
            "range"
          ],
          "display": [
            "with-tooltip"
          ],
          "validation": [
            "none"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
      },
      "focusTokenGroups": [
        "range",
        "tooltip"
      ],
      "layout": "row",
      "render": {
        "label": "range",
        "compositionType": "slider-range"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA non-text (3:1)",
        "note": "Jeder Thumb braucht eigenes aria-label ('Min Preis', 'Max Preis'). Fill-Kontrast zum Track muss 3:1 einhalten."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "touch-target",
      "label": "Touch Target (44px)",
      "description": "Unsichtbarer 44px Klickbereich um den 20px Thumb — WCAG 2.5.8 Touch-Ergonomie.",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "orientation": [
            "horizontal"
          ],
          "mode": [
            "single"
          ],
          "display": [
            "plain"
          ],
          "validation": [
            "none"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
      },
      "focusTokenGroups": [
        "thumb"
      ],
      "layout": "row",
      "render": {
        "label": "touch-target",
        "compositionType": "slider-touch-target"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA non-text (3:1)",
        "note": "Touch-Target 44x44px via Input-Hoehe. Sichtbarer Thumb bleibt kompakt (20px)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "display-variants",
      "label": "Display Variants",
      "description": "Plain, Floating Tooltip, statischer Output, Labels, Full",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "orientation": [
            "horizontal"
          ],
          "mode": [
            "single"
          ],
          "display": "*",
          "validation": [
            "none"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
      },
      "layout": "grid",
      "layoutConfig": {
        "rowAxis": "display"
      },
      "render": {
        "label": "{display}"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Output- und Label-Texte muessen 4.5:1 Kontrast haben. Tooltip ist aria-hidden='true'."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "orientation-variants",
      "label": "Horizontal vs Vertical",
      "description": "Standard (horizontal) vs vertikale Ausrichtung",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "orientation": "*",
          "mode": [
            "single"
          ],
          "display": [
            "plain"
          ],
          "validation": [
            "none"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
      },
      "layout": "grid",
      "layoutConfig": {
        "rowAxis": "orientation"
      },
      "render": {
        "label": "{orientation}"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA non-text (3:1)",
        "note": "Vertikal: writing-mode: vertical-lr + direction: rtl fuer Bottom-to-Top. Keyboard-Navigation bleibt identisch."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "error-state",
      "label": "Error State",
      "description": "Slider mit Error-Markierung (Thumb-Border + Fill in Danger-Farbe)",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "orientation": [
            "horizontal"
          ],
          "mode": [
            "single"
          ],
          "display": [
            "with-tooltip"
          ],
          "validation": [
            "error"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
      },
      "layout": "row",
      "render": {
        "label": "error"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA non-text (3:1)",
        "note": "Error: Thumb-Border und Fill wechseln zu danger-Farbe. aria-invalid='true' auf dem Input. Farbe nie alleiniges Signal."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "with-form-field",
      "label": "In Form Field",
      "description": "Slider im Form-Field Wrapper mit Label und Floating Tooltip",
      "composes": [
        "form-field",
        "form-label"
      ],
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "orientation": [
            "horizontal"
          ],
          "mode": [
            "single"
          ],
          "display": [
            "with-tooltip"
          ],
          "validation": [
            "none"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
      },
      "layout": "row",
      "render": {
        "compositionType": "slider-form-field",
        "label": "form-field"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA non-text (3:1)",
        "note": "Label via for-Attribut mit Slider verknuepft. aria-valuetext fuer menschenlesbare Wert-Beschreibung."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "full-featured",
      "label": "Full Featured",
      "description": "Slider mit Floating Tooltip, Min/Max Labels und Fill-Track",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "orientation": [
            "horizontal"
          ],
          "mode": [
            "single"
          ],
          "display": [
            "full"
          ],
          "validation": [
            "none"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
      },
      "layout": "row",
      "render": {
        "compositionType": "slider-full",
        "label": "full"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA non-text (3:1)",
        "note": "Tooltip zeigt aktuellen Wert (via JS synchronisiert). Min/Max Labels beschreiben den Wertebereich visuell."
      }
    }
  ]
}